**The steps below were therefore designed for this bench**, from the title (the subject is the
802.1X encryption type **EAP-PEAP**) and from the standing depth rule (the step text is the
floor: also prove the feature OFF first, and carry a control): baseline OFF, enable, authenticate,
and refuse two different kinds of bad credential in the same window.

