`tools/wpasup.py` is new in this run. It starts the capture **first**, then runs
`wpa_supplicant -D wired`, then decodes the pcap, so the capture can never start after the
exchange it was meant to record. **The capture filter is `ether proto 0x888e`** — mandatory on
